      "paper/main.tex": "\\documentclass{article}\n\\usepackage{amsmath}\n\\newcommand{\\study}{careful reading}\n\\newcommand{\\term}[1]{\\textbf{#1}}\n\\title{The case for careful reading}\n\\author{An example essay}\n\\begin{document}\n\\maketitle\n\\section{Background}\nRepeated phrase. 中文文本：读得更仔细。 Repeated phrase.\n\nWe use \\study{} and \\term{exact anchors}, with \\emph{emphasis} and a citation \\cite{smith2024}. A footnote\\footnote{This is the complete footnote.} stays visible.\n\n\\section{Methods}\nBefore $E=mc^2$ after. The expression is atomic.\n\\[\n\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx=\\frac13\n\\]\n\\begin{itemize}\n\\item First item.\n\\item Second item with \\textbf{bold text}.\n\\end{itemize}\n\\begin{tabular}{ll}\nName & Value \\\\\nAlpha & 42 \\\\\n\\end{tabular}\n\\begin{figure}\n\\includegraphics[width=.5\\textwidth]{diagram.svg}\n\\caption{An example figure.}\n\\end{figure}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}\\draw (0,0) -- (1,1);\\end{tikzpicture}\n\\input{conclusion}\n\\end{document}\n",
      "paper/conclusion.tex": "\\section{Conclusion}\nIncluded text has its own source coordinates. Unsupported \\mystery{content} must stay visible.\n\nA long paragraph with a repeated phrase. The repeated phrase is intentional.\n"
    },
