    "text": "The case for careful reading\n\nBackground\n\nRepeated phrase. 中文文本：读得更仔细。 Repeated phrase.\n\nWe use careful reading and exact anchors, with emphasis and a citation [smith2024]. A footnote [Footnote: This is the complete footnote.] stays visible.\n\nMethods\n\nBefore E=mc^2 after. The expression is atomic.\n\n\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx=\\frac13\n\nFirst item.\n\nSecond item with bold text.\n\nName \t Value \n Alpha \t 42\n\n[Image: diagram.svg]\n\nAn example figure.\n\n[Unsupported environment: tikzpicture]\n\nConclusion\n\nIncluded text has its own source coordinates. Unsupported [Unsupported command: \\mystery{content}] must stay visible.\n\nA long paragraph with a repeated phrase. The repeated phrase is intentional.",
